<!-- MOD: add custom widgets to the title -->
<!-- NovaTV: header = logo | wide search pill (+ mic) | pip, language, clock/date, avatar,
     with a row of category chips below. All upstream ids are kept (TitleView/NavigateTitleView use them). -->

